## 1. Verified Root Cause (from code analysis, no production access needed)

### 1.1 Dashboard data pipeline (VERIFIED from source)

The admin dashboard (`src/app/admin/dashboard/page.tsx`) consumes three endpoints, **none of which filter out test data**:

| Metric | Endpoint | Query (verified from `src/app/api/admin/stats/route.ts`) | Test-data filtering? |
